@*
 * Utility functions for waltzing-ui components
 *
 * Note: cn, class_if, and class_toggle are built-in waltzing helpers
 * that accept both &str and String via AsRef<str>. No need to redefine them.
 *
 * Built-in helpers available:
 *   @cn(&["base-class", conditional_class, "always-class"])
 *   @class_if(is_active, "active")
 *   @class_toggle(is_open, "open", "closed")
 *@
